  <main class="page">
    <h1>Not found</h1>
    <p>No page of this site is at this address.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">The prover</a>: type a sequent of linear logic and prove it.</li>
      <li><a href="/linlog/">linlog's documentation</a>, the library's API.</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/linlog-prover/linlog">linlog on GitHub</a>.</li>
      <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>: what the site keeps of you, and what GitHub logs.</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</Base>
